node_modules/

# The row firehose is host-local and enormous (one line per top-level
# declaration of a 1.2 GB corpus), and it is derived from bytes that are
# themselves gitignored. The FOLDS are committed instead — out/histogram.json
# and out/gate-report.json — because those are the reviewable evidence, and
# corpus-manifest.json's declCounts because that is the committed artifact
# the whole lane exists to fill.
out/*/*.rows.jsonl
